  "label": {
    "en": [
      "Vintage monochrome postcard with a printed photograph on the left showing a stone chapel with a bell-gable and small rose window, next to a stone wayside cross in a rural, wooded setting. The top margin reads \"CAPILLA DEL ESTABLECIMIENTO,\" and below the image it says \"AGUAS DE MONDARIZ\" with the printer's credit \"HAUSER Y MENET – MADRID\" and number 413. The right half of the card is blank for writing."
